{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51395","headline":"莺莺歌（逸句〖1〗） 二 · 李绅","name":"莺莺歌（逸句〖1〗） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此时潘郎未相识，偶住莲馆对南北。\n潜叹凄惶阿母心，爲求白马将军力。\n明明飞诏五云下，将选金门兵悉罢。\n阿母深居鸡犬安，八珍玉食邀郎餐。\n千言万语对生意，小女初笄爲姊妹。\n（同上〖卷三〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}